{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, actionUrl, frontendUrl, isStage1, isStage2, isStage3, isStage4 --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}}, 👋</p>

{{#if isStage1}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Your {{platformName}} profile is almost ready 👀</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  You've started creating your <strong>{{platformName}}</strong> profile — just a few minutes left to get it live.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Once your profile is complete, brands can discover you and place paid orders with you. 💸
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  You'll also get your own professional Creator Portfolio that you can share with brands or add to your Instagram bio.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  It takes around 5 minutes to finish.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Complete My Profile →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Don't miss an opportunity just because your profile wasn't ready. 🚀
</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if isStage2}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">You started it. Don't leave it halfway 👀</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Your <strong>{{platformName}}</strong> profile is still incomplete, which means you're not discoverable by brands yet.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  You've already done the hard part by getting started.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Take a few minutes, finish your profile and get yourself listed for paid brand opportunities. 💸
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Complete My Profile →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Your next brand collaboration could start with simply finishing what you already started.
</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if isStage3}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">What if a brand is looking for someone like you?</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Brands don't always need creators with millions of followers.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Sometimes they're simply looking for the right face, style, niche or content for their brand.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  But they can only discover you if your <strong>{{platformName}}</strong> profile is complete.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Complete your profile, showcase your work and make yourself available for paid opportunities.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label=(concat "Get Listed on " platformName " →")}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  It only takes a few minutes. ✨
</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if isStage4}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Still want to be listed on {{platformName}}?</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Your creator profile is still waiting to be completed.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Until it's live, brands can't discover your profile or place an order with you.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  If becoming a paid creator is something you want to explore, don't let an unfinished profile be the reason you miss an opportunity.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  5 minutes. One profile. And you're ready to be discovered. 🚀
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Complete My Profile →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">
  Stuck or have questions?
  <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/contact" style="color:#e11d48;text-decoration:underline;">Contact us</a> — we're happy to help.
</p>
{{/if}}

<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— Team {{platformName}} 💗</p>
